    "body": "Thanks, @annevk ! -- I'll take care of the nits and push again.\r\nFor testing, we have WPT for:\r\n* [allowfullscreen behaviour](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/3cc0d8989b9530f5fa9096ed03bac1e3ed5bf066)\r\n* [allowpaymentrequest behaviour](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/9a00e4ac75040e82297b733731151ff77ac37f2b)\r\n* [content attributes](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/10966) (I was waiting for this PR to land before merging)\r\n* And there is an outstanding question about allowusermedia here: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/4625",
